| 6. Interrogation-readiness | Converted into interview method, **12** |
| 7. Scan-level craft | Merged into **2** |
| 8. Zoom-level craft | Merged into **2** |
| 9. Micro-intentionality | Merged into **3** |
| 10. Shell versus work | Merged into **3** |
| 11. Provenance texture | Moved to walkthrough, **10** |
| 12. Honest attribution | Merged into **4** |
| 13. Scope-role coherence | Merged into **4** |
| 14. Checkable trail | Kept as **6** |
| 15. Causal chain | Merged into **5** |
| 16. Consequence altitude | Merged into **5** |
| 17. Force multiplication | Merged into **8** |
| 18. Upward influence | Merged into **8**; mechanism verified at **11** |
| 19. Writing economy | Merged into **7b** (test preserved) |
| 20. Retellable agency | Merged into **7c** (test preserved) |